B.S5=new A.bx("lore_tore_doctrines",B.pE,"T\xf6re Meclisi & Doktrin Kartlar\u0131","T\xf6re Council & Doctrine Cards","Ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n yasalar\u0131n\u0131 belirleyen Ekonomik, Askeri, G\xf6\xe7ebe ve Joker doktrin fermanlar\u0131.","Equip Economic, Military, Nomadic, and Wildcard doctrine decrees in the T\xf6re Council.","Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 Seviye 2 oldu\u011funda a\xe7\u0131lan T\xf6re Meclisi, 4 farkl\u0131 yuvaya doktrin kart\u0131 takman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar:\n\n1. Ekonomik Yuva: Sulama Ferman\u0131 (+%25 tarla bereketi), Maden \u0130mtiyaz\u0131 (+%30 demir).\n2. Askeri Yuva: Bozk\u0131r Ak\u0131nc\u0131s\u0131 (Fetih maliyetinde -%20 indirim), S\u0131n\u0131r Karakolu.\n3. G\xf6\xe7ebe Yuvas\u0131: K\u0131\u015f Ota\u011f\u0131 (Zud yak\u0131t\u0131nda -%40 tasarruf), Yaylak S\xfcr\xfcs\xfc.\n4. Joker Yuva: Kutlu Balbal (Tamga ve tap\u0131nak gelirlerine +%50 \xe7arpan).\n\nDoktrinler Kut/\u015ean puan\u0131 ile a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r ve istenildi\u011fi an mecliste de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.","Unlocked at Tent Level 2, the T\xf6re Council lets you slot decrees into Economic, Military, Nomadic, and Wildcard slots using Crown points.",B.SH,B.c7,"MECL\u0130S & YASA",B.a2q,B.a_0,B.YH,B.a0i,B.Vm,B.VV)
