B.UU=new A.vZ("\u015eAFAK VE \u0130LK OCAK","DAWN OF THE STEPPE","B\xd6L\xdcM I","CHAPTER I","U\xe7suz bucaks\u0131z Avrasya bozk\u0131rlar\u0131nda r\xfczgar dindi. Kadim boylar kutlu bir \xf6nderin sanca\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda toplanmay\u0131 bekliyor. Atalar\u0131n buyru\u011fu a\xe7\u0131kt\u0131r: \xc7ad\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 kur, oca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yak ve topra\u011f\u0131 dinle. \xc7ay\u0131rlardan bi\xe7ilen ilk ba\u015fak ve ormanlardan yontulan ilk kereste, y\xfckselecek kutlu ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk ad\u0131m\u0131d\u0131r.","The wind stills across the vast Eurasian steppe. Nomadic tribes await unification beneath the sacred banner of a destined Khagan. Pitch your tent, kindle the ancestral hearth, and heed the earth. The first wheat harvested and logs hewn shall lay the foundations of an eternal empire.",'"\xdcstte mavi g\xf6k, altta ya\u011f\u0131z yer k\u0131l\u0131nd\u0131kta, ikisi aras\u0131nda insano\u011flu k\u0131l\u0131nm\u0131\u015f..."','"When the blue sky above and the dark earth below were fashioned, between them were fashioned the sons of men..."',B.p)
B.UV=new A.vZ("BENG\xdc TA\u015e VE KAD\u0130M T\xd6RE","RUNIC STELE & SACRED LAW","B\xd6L\xdcM II","CHAPTER II","Sislerin ard\u0131nda dikilen Orhun yaz\u0131tlar\u0131, g\xf6\u011fe ve yere kaz\u0131nm\u0131\u015f t\xf6reyi f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor. Bilgelik olmadan g\xfc\xe7 zay\u0131ft\u0131r. R\xfcnik yaz\u0131t ta\u015flar\u0131 y\xfckseldik\xe7e bozk\u0131r\u0131n kadim s\u0131rlar\u0131 uyan\u0131r; kervan hatlar\u0131 kurulur, nadasa b\u0131rak\u0131lan toprak nefes al\u0131r ve 12 Hayvanl\u0131 G\xf6ksel Takvim kutlu seferlere rehberlik eder.","Rising through mountain mists, the Orkhon runic steles whisper the sacred laws carved into stone. Strength without wisdom falters. Erect runic monuments to awaken ancient steppe lore; weave caravan trade networks, practice seasonal transhumance, and let the 12-Year Celestial Calendar guide your path.",'"Ey T\xfcrk Ka\u011fan\u0131! T\xf6reni, ilini kim bozabilir? Bilge ol, t\xf6reye uy, kut bul!"','"O Khagan of the Steppe! Who can overturn your law and realm? Be wise, uphold the Tore, and prosper!"',B.Q)
B.UW=new A.vZ("KUTLU FET\u0130H VE KOZM\u0130K Z\u0130RVE","CONQUEST & COSMIC PEAK","B\xd6L\xdcM III","CHAPTER III","Alt\u0131gen karolar s\u0131n\u0131r tan\u0131maz bir g\xfc\xe7le geni\u015fliyor. Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131n kubbesiyle g\xf6\u011fe y\xfckselirken, d\xfc\u015fman ak\u0131nlar\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 ta\u015f ve demir surlar \xf6r\xfcl\xfcyor. Zud f\u0131rt\u0131nalar\u0131na g\xf6\u011f\xfcs gerecek, Toy Co\u015fkusuyla t\xfcm diyar\u0131 birle\u015ftireceksiniz. Kaderiniz tahtta, s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131z ufuklar\u0131n \xf6tesindedir.","Hexagonal lands expand beneath your unyielding will. As the golden dome of the Khan Tent pierces the clouds, stone and iron ramparts rise against raiders. Weather the harshest Zud blizzards, unite the realm through Toy Frenzy, and forge a legacy that echoes through eternity.",'"G\xfcnd\xfcz oturmad\u0131m, gece uyumad\u0131m... T\xfcrk milleti i\xe7in ili, t\xf6reyi kazand\u0131m!"','"By day I did not sit idle, by night I did not sleep... For the people I won the realm and the law!"',B.F)
