B.a2x=new A.an(B.mb,["HexRush Khaganate","Food","Wood","Flour","Plank","Bread","Furniture","Stone","Iron","Glory / Renown","Land","Spring","Summer","Autumn","Winter","Spring Has Arrived","Summer Has Begun","Autumn Harvest Has Begun","Winter Frost Has Fallen","WARNING: Severe Zud Blizzard!","Herds thrive, pasture fertility surges","Food and grain production at peak","Wood and lumber yield +25%, harvest time","Frost and cold: Food yields reduced by 50%","Critical blizzard: All production reduced by 40%!","Year","Conquer Land","Cost","FREE","Build","Upgrade","Collect","Level","/s","10x Steppe Surge","Settings","Privacy Policy","Language","Sound","Mute","Reset Game","Khan's Yurt","The heart of your steppe realm. Expands traditions and unlocks new structures.","Global Speed Bonus","Next Unlock","Meadow","Forest","Mountain","Sea","Desert","Tundra","Volcano","Wetlands","Celestial Crater","Celestial Crater","Ancestral Kurgan","Ancestral Kurgan","Crystal Chasm","Crystal Chasm","Wheat Field","Produces staple wheat and provisions.","Barley Field","Frost-resilient steppe grain that yields in cold weather.","Steppe Pasture","Grazing herds and steppe horses; high food and meat yield.","Steppe Orchard","Wild fruits that surge in summer and autumn.","Stone Quarry","Excavates pure stone blocks for khaganate construction.","Birch & Resin Camp","Harvests high quality birch timber and yurt insulation.","Lumberjack Camp","Produces timber.","Windmill","Converts Food into Flour.","Sawmill Works","Converts Wood into Planks.","Stone Hearth Bakery","Produces Bread from Flour & Food.","Carpenter Lodge","Produces Furniture from Planks.","Worker Hut","Automates raw material and ore collection. (Cannot store food; food is stored in Food Storehouse)","Defense Watchtower","3-Hex range archer tower; automatically shoots approaching enemies.","Mine Quarry","Produces Stone and Iron.","Wooden Bridge","Allows crossing water tiles.","Fisherman","Produces food from water tiles.","Fisherman Hut","Collection point for fishermen.","Oasis Cistern","Clears drought and gives +40% fertility aura.","Silk Road Caravanserai","Trades goods for bread and wealth.","Desert Astrolabe","Maps desert stars for celestial guidance.","Reindeer Sanctuary","Produces frost-resilient food and warmth.","Geothermal Bath","Doubles worker speed with warm spring steam.","Permafrost Dig","Excavates mammoth fossils and iron ore.","Steam Vent Dynamo","Generates steam pressure and stone.","Obsidian Master Forge","Forges obsidian-hardened tools and iron.","Herbalist Yurt","Brews nourishing remedies from wetland flora.","Reed Scribe Workshop","Crafts ancient scrolls and planks.","Celestial Anvil","Forges rare Meteoric Steel from fallen meteorites.","Ancestral Totem","Channels cumulative migration heritage.","Prismatic Resonator","Doubles the power of all sacred shrines.","Food Storehouse","Specialized food logistics storehouse providing 10x transfer capacity for food supplies. Worker huts cannot store food.","Kumis Yurt","Ferments mare milk to brew traditional steppe kumis.","Felt Tent Workshop","Processes raw wool into sturdy felt for yurts and commerce.","Damascus Master Forge","Forges Damascus steel ingots through layered metallurgy.","Orkhon Runic Stele","Inscribes ancient steppe knowledge to generate Lore for the T\xf6re tree.","Steppe Bazaar","Trade goods for stone, iron, and glory.","Trade","T\xf6re & Council","Empower your realm with ancient traditions and titles.","Learn","Claim Title","Warm (+50% Speed)","Requires Yurt Lv.{0}","Hauling Capacity","Utilized","Idle","Logistics Load","Capacity","{0} Production Buildings in Range","Production & Consumption Breakdown","Total Production","Total Consumption","Net Balance","Gross Production Rate","Net Transported Income","Logistics Bottleneck","Surplus production is accumulating due to limited hauling capacity or being out of 4-hex range. Build Worker Huts or Food Storehouses. (Food requires Food Storehouse)","PRODUCERS","CONSUMERS","No active buildings producing or consuming this resource.","HEXPEDIA - STEPPE ENCYCLOPEDIA","Search mechanics, buildings or biomes...","MECHANIC STATS & FORMULAS","STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE","TACTICAL STEPPE TIPS","No matching mechanics or guides found.","WELCOME, KHAGAN OF THE STEPPE","Cancel","Confirm","Yes","No","Close","SKIP","PREV","NEXT","BEGIN ADVENTURE","DAWN OF THE STEPPE","Great Migration & Realm Renewal","Confirm Great Migration","All buildings and resources will reset, but you will earn Crowns and Tamgas for permanent bonuses. Do you want to proceed?","YES, START MIGRATION","CROWNS TO EARN","ANCESTRAL TAMGA","GLORY MULTIPLIER","MIGRANT MEMORY","TOTAL MIGRATIONS","TAMGA COUNT","PERMANENT BONUS","No Great Migration completed yet.\nYour migration history will be saved here after your first migration.","STEPPE RAID","RAID INFO & DEFENSE STRATEGY","SOUND EFFECTS","STEPPE MUSIC","ON","OFF","NOTIFICATION PREFERENCES","DEVELOPER ACCOUNT (@balaxstudio)","DELETE MY DATA","DELETE ALL DATA","All your game saves, legacies, and progress will be permanently deleted. This action cannot be undone. Are you sure?","Storage Full Alert (80%)","Season Change Alert","Quest Complete Alert","Yurt Upgrade Ready Alert","NEO-BRUTALIST THEME PALETTE","GREAT MIGRATION SCREEN","STEPPE EPIC (INTRO STORY)","CLAIMING REWARD","Claiming reward, please wait...","RENOWN & CROWN BREAKDOWN","Great Migration Reset Calculation","STEPPE DIORAMA SNAPSHOT","Diorama snapshot saved to gallery!","REALM SELECTION","T\xd6RE WISDOM TREE","Wisdom","Claim","Claimed","Locked","Unlock","EQUIPPED","EQUIP","ACTIVE","INACTIVE","hours","minutes","seconds","OWNED","WILD","ANCIENT STEPPE MATRIX","Activating Isometric Voxel Engine...","LOADING","ORHUN BITIG STONES & LORE TREE","BITIG","Logistics","Heating","Soil","Casting","UNLOCKED","SILK ROAD ENVOY ORDERS","No pending envoy orders at this time.","DELIVERED","DELIVER ORDER","ACTIVE REALM","SELECT THIS REALM","ALTAI CELESTIAL PLATEAUS","Abundance of Mines, Quarries & Damascus Steel","\u2022 Stone, Iron and Damascus Steel production doubled.\n\u2022 30% discount on Mountain and Crater tile conquest costs.\n\u2022 Harsh winters and high Kurgan legacy synergy.","VOLGA-URAL RIVER BASIN","Abundance of Fishing, Wetlands & Kumis Yurt","\u2022 Fish, Food, Flour and Kumis production doubled.\n\u2022 30% discount on Sea and Reed tile conquest costs.\n\u2022 +50% prosperity resonance adjacent to rivers and lakes.","KARAKUM & TARIM OASES","Silk Road Caravans, Market Barter & Felt Abundance","\u2022 Caravan speed, Market barter profits and Crown yield doubled.\n\u2022 Felt and yurt production is 50% faster.\n\u2022 25% discount on Desert and Oasis tile conquest costs.","CONFIRM GREAT MIGRATION?","Your current lands and resources will be reset; your tribe will migrate to a new era.\n\nLegacy to Earn:\n\u2022 +{0} Crowns (Renown & Glory)\n\u2022 +{1} Permanent Ancestral Tamga\n\u2022 Your buildings will turn into Ancestral Kurgans.\n\nAre you sure you want to proceed?","GREAT MIGRATION (PRESTIGE & KUT MULTIPLIER)","Eternal Steppe Victory Cycle & Heritage Multiplier","PERMANENT LEGACY TO EARN IN THIS MIGRATION","LEGACY & REWARD BREAKDOWN","SACRED OATHS (CHALLENGE MODIFIERS)","TARGET EXPEDITION REALM SELECTION","Resources","ETERNAL REALM VICTORIES:","Orkhon Runic Steles (Cultural)","Great Silk Road Network (Logistics)","4 Ancient Realm Dominance (Geographic)","Oath of Steel (+15% Glory)","Iron & mine progression boost \u2022 Extra Tamga yield","Oath of Permafrost (+15% Glory)","Resilience against harsh winter & Zud blizzards","Great Steppe (Standard)","Balanced meadows, forests & mineral basins","Silk Road Oases","Desert biomes, caravanserai & trade boost","Altay Highlands","Tundra & geothermal baths frost challenge","Realm not ready for migration (Requires Yurt Lv. 5 & 12 Tiles)","Requires Yurt Lv. 5 and 12 Tiles for Migration.","START GREAT MIGRATION","MIGRATION LOCKED","SELECTED","MIGRATION MULTIPLIERS & GUIDE","POST-MIGRATION REWARDS & GAINS SUMMARY","Global Production Speed (Kut)","Worker & Food Storehouse Carry Volume","Permanent Ancestral Tamgas","Glory Crowns to Gain","Permanent Logistics & Carry (Kut & Migration Grace)","The Kut yield increase earned in Great Migration permanently boosts worker and granary carrying capacity at the exact same rate as resource production, ensuring logistics automatically scales with production.","Kut Blessing & Production Multiplier (Heavenly Grace)","Kut Blessing directly multiplies the baseline production speed of ALL resources (wheat, wood, stone, iron, flour, bread, etc.) in your new settlement. Every 1 Tamga = +4% Production Speed, every Migration = +5% Permanent Kut, every Great Victory = +25% Kut.","How to Earn Multipliers & Crowns?","Khan Yurt: Lv. 5+ unlocks migration. Every 2 Yurt levels = +1 Crown.","Land Conquest: Every 20 conquered hex tiles and each Ancient Shrine (+5 pts) = +1 Ancestral Tamga.","Building Investment: Every 15 total building levels = +1 Crown.","Ancient Shrines: Every discovered Ancient Shrine = +1 Crown & holy logistics/production aura.","Prosperity Stock: High stored warehouse resources (5K - 500K) = +1 to +4 Extra Crowns.","Fish","Kumis","Felt","Damascus Steel","STEPPE OFFLINE GAINS","Offline steppe gains transferred to storage.","With steppe blessing, 2.0x doubled offline gains transferred to storage!","Swift Horse Courier","Expands worker transport range by +1 Hex and increases caravan speed by +25%.","Silk Road Network","Increases caravan trade synergy by +50%.","Khaganate Postal System","Doubles worker transport capacity across the entire map.","Thick Felt Weaving","Reduces heating wood cost for frozen tiles by 30% in winter.","Hearth Fire Gathering","Increases winter production multiplier of heated tiles by +40%.","Zud Resilience","Halves the negative production penalty of Zud blizzards.","Seasonal Pasture Migration","Doubles soil health regeneration rate on fallow meadows (2x).","Blessed Seed Breeding","Increases base harvest yield on all fields and orchards by +35%.","Soil Respiration Burst","Triples the respiration burst multiplier of rested soil (3x).","Bellows Forge Refinement","Increases ore and iron extraction speed from mines by +30%.","Damascus Steel Secret","Increases Damascus Steel foundry efficiency by +50%.","Modu Chanyu Bows & Blades","Doubles global yield of all mining and crafting structures (2x).","ECONOMICS","MILITARY","NOMADIC","WILDCARD","ACCUMULATED STOCK:","ESTABLISH SILK ROAD CARAVAN ROUTE","Origin","CONNECTED","CONNECT","ERECT BENG\xdc STELE (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","LINK SILK ROAD (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","UNIFY REALMS (+15 Tamga, +25% Kut)","Goal: Declare Eternal Victory with 500 Lore or 4 Caravan Routes.","CLAIMING REWARD","Claiming reward, please wait...","DIORAMA & REALM SEAL","STEPPE KHAGANATE DIORAMA","FULLSCREEN DIORAMA","Conquered: {0} Tiles","Zuds Survived: {0}","Highest Yield: {0}","SACRED LEGACY CHEST","Increase ancestral tamgas by +1 to start the new era stronger.","TIME TO MIGRATE!","SACRED MIGRATION TIME HAS COME!","First era complete \u2022 Growth is slowing","Your realm reached its first borders. Start Great Migration now to earn permanent Tamgas and Kut Multipliers!","LATER","MIGRATE NOW","GLORY & CROWN BREAKDOWN","CURRENT CROWNS","TO EARN IN MIGRATION","CROWN CALCULATION & YIELD DETAILS","STEPPE RAID: LEVEL {0}","REMAINING ENEMIES: {0}","RAID HORN: LEVEL {0}","Yurt Damaged (Repair Needed)","Highest: Level {0}","Challenge Steppe Raiders","REPAIR YURT","STEPPE NOMAD","REALM CONQUEROR","SILK ROAD MERCHANT","ZUD MASTER","GREAT KHAGAN","G\xd6K TENGR\u0130: RAIN BLESSING","TONYUKUK: SILK WEB","TONYUKUK: STONE ROADS","K\xdcL T\u0130G\u0130N: BRAVE HEART","Envoy: {0} \u2022 Reward: {1}x Gold Rush Speed ({2} min)"],t.w)
